# [DETNET](../wg/detnet.html)

## Summary

The Deterministic Networking (DETNET) Working Group met during IETF 121. The session was co-chaired by János Farkas (remote) and Lou Berger (in-room), with Eve Schooler serving as secretary. 

The session covered working group administration, liaison updates with ITU-T SG13, and status reviews across active working group drafts and individual contributions. Technical discussions focused on multi-domain control frameworks, SRv6 service protection data plane implementations, data plane taxonomy, queuing and latency guarantee mechanisms (NSCORE, TCQF, gLBF, PIFO, and On-Time Forwarding), PREOF observability and OAM requirements, the applicability of ACTN to DetNet, and multipath traffic engineering for wireless DetNet.

