## Decisions and Action Items

1. **Document Status Reporting**: Authors of inactive/expired WG drafts must post status reports and requests for guidance directly to the WG mailing list.
2. **`draft-ietf-detnet-multi-domain-framework`**: Authors will review text alongside Lou Berger to ensure distributed/peering models are presented with equal standing to hierarchical models. Generic questions from the ACTN applicability draft will be incorporated.
3. **`draft-ietf-detnet-dataplane-taxonomy`**: The draft will be held while data plane solution drafts progress, but chairs will request an early Transport Area (TSV) review.
4. **`draft-ietf-detnet-stateless-fair-queuing`**: Jinou Joung will initiate updates to ITU-T SG13 Recommendations Y.3129 and Y.3148 to maintain full alignment with the IETF specification.

